WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.584 --> 00:00:20.675
If I were a pilot, I could fly a plane.

2
00:00:20.676 --> 00:00:30.129
If I were a doctor, I could help sick people get better.

3
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:38.649
If I were a fisherman, I could catch many fish.

4
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:47.843
If I were a police officer, I could catch criminals.

5
00:00:47.844 --> 00:00:57.323
If I were a builder, I could build houses.

6
00:00:57.324 --> 00:01:05.561
If I were a farmer, I could grow rice.

7
00:01:05.562 --> 00:01:14.870
If I were a teacher, I could teach children how to read.

8
00:01:14.871 --> 00:01:19.259
What do you want to be?
